  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 with resnet50 and transformer aggregation achieves high accuracy. This experiment tests using pca_n2000 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion, isolating the impact of RNA/image encoder choices. It addresses uncertainty about whether switching to a larger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) or different RNA encoder (pca_n2000) would improve performance, while keeping aggregation/fusion consistent with top performers."
}

